  Id: among_the_refugees
  Title: AMONG THE REFUGEES
  Body: One of the newcomers turns out to be a master craftsman.
  BodyVariants:
  - "One of the newcomers turns out to be a guild craftsman \u2014 the kind cities
    used to fight over. He owes us for the open gate, and he knows it."
  OutcomeA: "He works a week's worth in a single day: {GAIN_N} {GAIN_RES}, guild-stamped.
    'Debt paid,' he says \u2014 and means it."
  OutcomeB: He hangs his tools by the {BOOST_RES} yards. Output up {BOOST_PCT}% for
    {BOOST_D} days.
  Contrast: 0
